{"source": "flora-malesiana", "source_id": "vol14_final.xml", "taxon": "Myristicaceae", "organ": "habit", "language": "en", "text": "Dioecious or monoecious (Endocomia) monopodial shrubs or trees with aromatic oil- cells, (2-)5-15(-40) m high (Virola sessilis, Brazil, 30 cm high); stilt-roots sometimes present; branching whorled, the crown often pyramidal.", "assertions": [{"po_id": "PO_0000003", "pato_id": "PATO_0000119", "po_label": "whole plant", "pato_label": "height", "negated": false, "value_low": 5, "value_high": 15, "unit": "m", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "(2-)5-15(-40) m high"}, {"po_id": "PO_0000042", "pato_id": "PATO_0000467", "po_label": "shoot-borne root", "pato_label": "present", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "sometimes", "source_text": "stilt-roots sometimes present"}, {"po_id": "PO_0025029", "pato_id": "PATO_0001951", "po_label": "shoot axis", "pato_label": "whorled", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "branching whorled"}, {"po_id": "PO_0000003", "pato_id": "PATO_0002336", "po_label": "whole plant", "pato_label": "pyramidal", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "often", "source_text": "the crown often pyramidal"}]}
{"source": "flora-malesiana", "source_id": "vol14_final.xml", "taxon": "Horsfieldia macrothyrsa Warb.", "organ": "inflorescences", "language": "en", "text": "Inflorescences with sparse hairs 0.1 mm or less; in male: about 3 times branched, ± few-flowered, 7-20 by 5-12 cm, peduncle 0.5-4.5 cm long; in female (according to infructescences): about twice branched, 3-6 cm long; bracts elliptic-oblong, 2-4 mm long, short-pubescent, caducous; flowers in male in loose clusters of 2-4, in female 1-3 together, glabrous; the perianth 3- (or 4-) lobed, pedicel not or but faintly articulated.", "assertions": [{"po_id": "PO_0009049", "pato_id": "PATO_0000454", "po_label": "inflorescence", "pato_label": "hairy", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "sparse", "modifier": "", "source_text": "Inflorescences with sparse hairs 0.1 mm or less"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009053", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "peduncle", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 0.5, "value_high": 4.5, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "peduncle 0.5-4.5 cm long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009054", "pato_id": "PATO_0000947", "po_label": "inflorescence bract", "pato_label": "elliptic", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "elliptic-oblong", "modifier": "", "source_text": "bracts elliptic-oblong, 2-4 mm long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009054", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "inflorescence bract", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 2, "value_high": 4, "unit": "mm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "bracts elliptic-oblong, 2-4 mm long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009054", "pato_id": "PATO_0000455", "po_label": "inflorescence bract", "pato_label": "pubescent", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "short-pubescent", "modifier": "", "source_text": "short-pubescent, caducous"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009046", "pato_id": "PATO